  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Acetylene is common the name of ethyne molecule. Polymerisation of alkynes&nbsp;produce addition polymers.&nbsp;Polymerisation of ethyne&nbsp;will produce poly-ethyne&nbsp;polymer. Polymers are large molecules formed by repeating units, which are known as monomers.<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a988a17d-8989-4126-922b-8ebb8810e47c-mlppp.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 95px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
